WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.222
This is the final completion page for Module 6.

00:00:03.222 --> 00:00:07.862
The module tracks ten knowledge checks and six coding exercises.

00:00:07.862 --> 00:00:14.467
Before selecting Complete Module, review the counters and make sure they represent the work you intended to

00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:20.527
finish. If an activity is incomplete, the page will list it and allow you to return to the relevant slide.

00:00:20.527 --> 00:00:25.777
When you select Complete Module, the page creates a Canvas submission summary.

00:00:25.777 --> 00:00:30.382
That summary includes your completion status, knowledge-check answers,

00:00:30.382 --> 00:00:33.622
and the SQL saved for each coding exercise.

00:00:33.622 --> 00:00:36.472
Review that summary before copying it.

00:00:36.472 --> 00:00:42.187
If the module is incomplete, the page will warn you before you copy the current progress.

00:00:42.187 --> 00:00:45.972
Remember that progress is stored locally in the current browser.

00:00:45.972 --> 00:00:51.467
If you switch computers, use a private browsing window, or clear browser storage,

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:53.937
the saved work may not follow you.

00:00:53.937 --> 00:00:57.622
Treat this page as a final quality-control step.

00:00:57.622 --> 00:01:03.672
In data work, reviewing the output before submitting or publishing is just as important as writing the query

00:01:03.672 --> 00:01:04.673
itself.
